# ---- Derived build artefacts -------------------------------------------
# Regenerated in ~2 minutes by:
#   python -m brain.connectivity.build_connectome
# The same connectome is committed in web/data/ for the browser build, so
# keeping this too would ship the identical graph twice.
data/derived/
simulation/outputs/

